**The Gap Between Talent and Skills: A New Empirical Framework for Analyzing Inequality of Opportunity in Spain**  
*Funded by a [BBVA Leonardo Grant](https://www.redleonardo.es/beneficiario/alicia-garcia-sierra/)*

This research project investigates inequality of opportunity by decoupling initial potential from subsequently acquired skills. By combining longitudinal data, early cognitive assessments, and genetic indicators associated with educational achievement, the project examines how socioeconomic backgrounds influence individual skill development and measures opportunity inequality in Spain.
